;-------------------------------
;Custom config section for new player handholding
;-------------------------------
@CUSTOM_OPTION_309
PRINTFORML [309] - Spoiler Mode (Global)：\@ nSpoilerMode ? Yes # No \@

@CUSTOM_OPTION_RESULT_309
SIF benchMarkStart
    RETURN
SIF DevTest && ゲーム開始処理中
    RETURN

LOADGLOBAL
SETCOLOR C_YELLOW
PRINTFORML "Spoiler Mode" Info
RESETCOLOR
PRINTFORML "Spoiler Mode" makes it so that obscure information is more explicitly shown to the player.
PRINTFORML This may include characters needed to fall, hidden talents, and other use-cases where more detailed info is needed.
PRINTFORML However, this may ruin the fun of discovering these things on your own.
PRINTFORML It is recommended to only enable this if you are truly lost.
SIF ゲーム開始処理中
PRINTFORML (Can be turned On or Off in Mod Feature Configuration)
IF nSpoilerMode
PRINTFORML List of changes when enabled:
PRINTFORML - Some hidden talents are now displayed on the Falling Conditions menu.
PRINTFORML - Cycle visualization is now always enabled.
PRINTFORML - Displays crafting requirements if an item cannot be created.
PRINTFORML - Characters that are needed to fall will now be listed if you don't have permission to do stuff.
PRINTFORML - End-of-Day pregnancy stats are now shown.
PRINTFORML - Current uterus volume is now shown, will also show the max volume and change to yellow once it's full.
PRINTFORML - Commands are sorted by risk level. 
PRINTFORML      White: Safe to execute
PRINTFORML      Yellow: May cause physical or relationship harm.
PRINTFORML      Orange: Will cause physical or relationship harm.
PRINTFORML      Red: Will cause severe physical or relationship harm, can be fatal
PRINTFORML      Dark Red: Will either kill the Touhou or cause her to become hostile.
ENDIF
$REINPUT
{
CALL ASK_M(
    @"Turn on Spoiler Mode", 1,
    @"Turn off Spoiler Mode",1,
    )
}
nSpoilerMode = !RESULT

SAVEGLOBAL
;max cum amounts
@CHARA_MAX_CUM(ARG)
#FUNCTION
SELECTCASE TALENT:ARG:体型
	CASE -5
		RETURNF 300
	CASE -4 TO -2
		RETURNF 600
	CASE -1
		RETURNF 1000
	CASE 0
		RETURNF 1200
	CASE IS > 0
		RETURNF 1500
ENDSELECT

;for uterus cums
@NPG_CUMS(ARG)
IF EX:ARG:子宮内精液 > 0
    SIF nSpoilerMode && 充填率(ARG,4) >= 100
        SETCOLOR C_YELLOW

        PRINTFORM  Cum in Uterus: %DIGIT_GROUP(EX:ARG:子宮内精液),5,LEFT%
    ;new player guide custom code
    SIF nSpoilerMode
        PRINTFORM /{CHARA_MAX_CUM(ARG)/2,5,RIGHT}
    SIF nSpoilerMode && 充填率(ARG,4) >= 100
        PRINTFORM (FULL)
    RESETCOLOR
ENDIF
